{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106290","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110629001:0":{"text":"정말 꿈을 꾸고 있는 것 같아... 소렌, 나 한 번만 꼬집어줘!","source_cn":"真像做梦一样啊……索恩，你掐我一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B4732A139CC2996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110629002:0":{"text":"싫어. 얼른 가자. 늑장 부리다가 다음 결투를 놓칠 수도 있어...","source_cn":"不要，快走了。不然因为赶不上决战而失败——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BEA930AA5B901E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110629003:0":{"text":"아아! 아니야, 안 돼. 진짜 그러면 아버지가 꿈에서도 나를 혼내실 거야! 어서 출발하자!","source_cn":"啊啊！别说了，要是出了这种事，梦里的老爹一定会罚我的！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB58C276BD1DE593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}